OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Amurdering woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial date has been set for a man
OL,7,Faccused of murdering a care worker.
OL,9,FAndrew Bell, 44, from Darlington,
OL,10,Fappeared at Teesside Crown Court
OL,11,Fcharged with the murder of 44-year-old
OL,12,FLeanne Park.
OL,14,FPolice were called to an address in
OL,15,FParkgate, Darlington, at about 21:15
OL,16,FBST on Wednesday, where they found her
OL,17,Fbody.
OL,19,FNo pleas were entered but a trial was
OL,20,Fset for 8 March 2027. Bell was remanded
OL,21,Fin custody ahead of a plea hearing set
OL,22,Ffor 26 October.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
